        "text": "=*Podcast content ready* - {{ $(\"Normalize Episode\").item.json.episodeTitle }}\n\n*Duration:* {{ $(\"Extract Transcript Data\").item.json.durationMin }} min  |  *Transcript:* {{ $(\"Extract Transcript Data\").item.json.wordCount }} words  |  *Speakers:* {{ $(\"Extract Transcript Data\").item.json.speakerCount }}  |  *Confidence:* {{ Math.round($(\"Extract Transcript Data\").item.json.confidence * 100) }}%\n*Processed in:* {{ $(\"Assemble Notion Payload\").item.json.processingSeconds }}s\n\n*Assets:* 250-word summary, 5-point exec summary, timestamped show notes, LinkedIn post, X thread, Facebook post, Instagram caption, 10 pull quotes, SEO blog draft, keywords and metadata\n\n<{{ $json.url }}|Open in Notion>",
